OL,3,GNEWSAJersey earnings rise by 1.2% after
OL,4,Ainflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAverage earnings in Jersey did not keep
OL,7,Fup with the rate of inflation for the
OL,8,Fyear to June, according to new figures.
OL,10,FStatistics Jersey said in June 2026
OL,11,Fearnings per full-time equivalent
OL,12,Femployee was 4.1% higher than in June
OL,13,F2025.
OL,15,FHowever, once adjusted for inflation -
OL,16,Fcurrently at 2.8% for the island -
OL,17,FStatistics Jersey said earnings rose by
OL,18,F1.2%, representing a real-terms pay
OL,19,Fcut.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
