OL,3,GNEWSAJersey earnings rise by 1.2% after
OL,4,Ainflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Index of Average Earnings June 2026
OL,7,Freport said the overall increase was
OL,8,Flower than the preceding five-year
OL,9,Fannual average of 5.6% per year and
OL,10,F"slightly lower" than the long-term
OL,11,Fannual average of 4.2% per year for
OL,12,F1991 to 2025.
